<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo tracks European currencies, weakens vs mark.</title>
<headline>Escudo tracks European currencies, weakens vs mark.</headline>
<text>
<p>1658 GMT - The escudo stayed in line with the peseta and French franc and closed weaker against the mark after a session marked by low liquidity. Dealers expected a quiet session tomorrow because of a holiday in Spain. The escudo closed at 101.01/06 per mark, compared with 100.98/01 at the opening.</p>
</text>
